  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "他種圧倒する　身体能力と　猛毒　有し寒冷なる　高地においては　敵なし。群れ成さず　単独を良しとする　性質。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "다른 종을 압도하는 신체 능력과 맹독을 가지고 있어 한랭한 고지대에서는 맞수가 없다. 무리를 이루지 않고 고독함을 즐긴다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "擁有凌駕其他物種之上的身體能力以及劇毒。在寒冷的高地上所向無敵。偏好獨自行動，而不會集結成群。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon n’a guère d’ennemis sur les hauteurs froidies, car ses aptitudes physiques sont sans égales et son poison est mortel. Il préfère la solitude à la vie en groupe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im frostigen Hochland kann diesem Einzelgänger kein anderes Pokémon das Wasser reichen, da er neben hochwirksamem Gift über herausragende körperliche Fähigkeiten verfügt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Gracias a su fortaleza física y potente veneno, ninguna especie de las alturas heladas le planta cara. Es de personalidad solitaria y no forma manadas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nei frigidi altipiani non ha pari grazie al veleno che produce e a capacità fisiche che nessun’altra specie può eguagliare. Non vive in branco e ben sopporta la solitudine.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Because of Sneasler’s virulent poison and daunting physical prowess, no other species could hope to best it on the frozen highlands. Preferring solitude, this species does not form packs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "他種圧倒する　身体能力と　猛毒　有し寒冷なる　高地においては　敵なし。群れ成さず　単独を良しとする　性質。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "legends-arceus",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/39/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "拥有凌驾其他物种之上的身体能力以及剧毒。在寒冷的高地上所向无敌。偏好独自行动，而不会集结成群。",
